  "description": "Steps 5–6, route 2c (task.123 / obs #112): five CONCERNS gates with HIGH 0 throughout and MEDIUM falling 4, 3, 2, 1 — the budget is spent on cycle 5's fix, which no gate has read. Loop Escalation evaluates the half-cycle before writing an entry: one ordinary qa-story (no qa-fix) writes gate.6, which reads PASS and hands to 5c. Fixture records qa-story×6, qa-fix×5, review-pr×1 — never six qa-fix, never a halt.",
  "prompt": "Run steps 5–6 (qa loop) of the develop-story pipeline for story.5.1.example. Cycles 1–5 read CONCERNS with HIGH 0 and MEDIUM 5, 4, 3, 2, 1; cycle 5's qa-fix lands and the budget is spent.",
  "assertions": [
    {
      "fn": "fileExists",
      "args": [
        "$SANDBOX/docs/prd/domain/feature/epics/epic.5.example/stories/story.5.1.example/story.5.1.gate.5.example.yml"
      ]
